 "lessons": [
  {
   "text": "Off Days is a DevExtreme tag box (multi-select) on cnr1dev1: input id DDL__epp1_offdays, placeholder 'Select...', options Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday in that order; no 'Select all', no checkboxes.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/live_look.md",
   "date": "2026-10-09"
  },
  {
   "text": "Off Days list closes after every pick: for each day, real-click the input to reopen the list, wait for the visible .dx-list-item, then real-click it. Hidden list items are not interactable.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-09"
  },
  {
   "text": "Off Days: choosing a day that is already selected removes it (the pick toggles the tag off).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P4 run)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Off Days tags are not inside #DDL__epp1_offdays (that id is the tag box input): read them from the parent tag box, document.getElementById('DDL__epp1_offdays').closest('.dx-tagbox').querySelectorAll('.dx-tag').",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P1 run)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Off Days cross-out: real click on the .dx-tag-remove-button of the tag, e.g. //div[contains(@class,'dx-tag-content') and normalize-space()='Friday']/*[contains(@class,'dx-tag-remove-button')]. The watcher logs it as a click on div.dx-tag with a generated id; never replay that id.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P2 rerun)",
   "date": "2026-10-15"
  },
  {
   "text": "Off Days are saved in the order they were selected.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (SDMS-6084 block)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "To read the Off Days options without changing data: open the list, read the .dx-list-item texts only, press Escape, then check there are still no new tags. Never click list items in a read-only case.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (TC01)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "window.jQuery is not available on this screen: read the tag box from the DOM (.dx-tag, input value), not through a dxTagBox instance.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Off Days",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (recheck)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Update: the clickable inner #updateBtn sits below the fold (about 1300 px down); a real click scrolls to it. The watcher logs the wrapper #update.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P6 run)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Tab Demographics is #tab_2, but tab ids tab_1..tab_5 occur twice on the page (cent-tab wrapper and nested dx-button-content), so the same id can point at another tab: locate the tab by its text or with a class qualifier.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/exec/TC01/20261014-live/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Report To (TXT__EPP1REPORTTO) is disabled on load when Sub Distributor = No (disabled=true, aria-disabled=true) and is shown red (invalid) until the first Update.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Report To",
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md; knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Clicking the same menu item again does not reset the screen (unsaved tags stay, the sidebar stays open over the grid). To reopen cleanly, reload the page and navigate again from the menu (a reload lands on Home).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P4 run)",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Distributor List grid shows only the distributor chosen at login. The code on the distributor selector is not always an HQ distributor code (some selections show 0 rows).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/SDMS-6084/20261009-1753/friction.md (P8 run)",
   "date": "2026-10-15"
  }
 ],
